# Vercel Blob Storage

The project uses Vercel Blob for deploy/runtime data assets.

- Store name: `decision-making-tool-blob`
- Store ID: `store_AaGiBoLq28sLYfoF`
- Public blob host: `https://aagibolq28slyfof.public.blob.vercel-storage.com`
- Local token file: `.env.local`
- Required env var: `BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN`

Never print or expose token values. Only report env var names or whether a token is present.

To list blobs locally, pass the token explicitly:

```bash
set -a && source .env.local && set +a
vercel blob list --rw-token "$BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN" --limit 1000 --prefix inputs/
```

Known public prefixes include:

- `inputs/costs/`
- `inputs/features/`
- `inputs/features/species/`
- `inputs/includes/`

Direct public blob URLs use the public host plus the pathname, for example:

```text
https://aagibolq28slyfof.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/inputs/features/ecosystems/ecosistemas.tif
```
